# Swiss Trading & Market Support Platform — code ownership.
#
# Constitution Principle I (Hexagonal Adapter Discipline) is partly enforced
# here: domain code under libs/domain-model/ MUST NOT be modified by adapter
# owners; adapter directories under apps/venue-adapter-*/ MUST NOT be modified
# by domain owners; the adapter ports stay narrow.
#
# The actual GitHub teams below are placeholders. Replace with real team
# slugs (`@swisstms/<team>`) once the GitHub org exists.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owner — every PR by default must be reviewed by the platform team.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                                              @swisstms/platform

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Domain core — owned by domain team. NOT reviewable by adapter teams.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/libs/domain-model/                            @swisstms/domain @swisstms/architecture
/libs/time-sync/                               @swisstms/regulatory @swisstms/platform
/libs/audit-chain/                             @swisstms/regulatory @swisstms/platform
/libs/pretrade-risk/                           @swisstms/risk @swisstms/platform

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Codecs and protocol libraries — owned by the codec sub-team.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/libs/fix-codec/                               @swisstms/codec
/libs/fix-codec-py/                            @swisstms/codec
/libs/sbe-codec/                               @swisstms/codec
/libs/fixml-codec/                             @swisstms/codec
/libs/fpml-codec/                              @swisstms/codec

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hot-path transport — owned by the latency team.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/libs/aeron-transport/                         @swisstms/latency
/apps/ems-service/                             @swisstms/latency @swisstms/platform
/apps/pretrade-risk-gateway/                   @swisstms/latency @swisstms/risk
